WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.584 --> 00:00:03.250
We are transformed, in a way,

00:00:03.334 --> 00:00:04.584
through this experience.

00:00:06.417 --> 00:00:08.209
All of us very much believe

00:00:08.292 --> 00:00:11.250
that this feels like the
most important movie we've ever made.

00:00:12.751 --> 00:00:16.417
That is what every crew member
focused on every day, and none more so

00:00:16.417 --> 00:00:18.500
than Ryan Coogler
at the helm of it all.

00:00:26.417 --> 00:00:27.959
Ryan has such a big heart

00:00:28.083 --> 00:00:30.042
and is such a great storyteller.

00:00:31.918 --> 00:00:37.375
The actors that he's brought together
were filled with emotion and passion.

00:00:37.959 --> 00:00:39.083
WINSTON DUKE
Reuniting with Ryan Coogler

00:00:39.083 --> 00:00:40.083
was incredible.

00:00:40.709 --> 00:00:42.250
LETITIA WRIGHT
His heart is really pure

00:00:43.792 --> 00:00:45.751
and we should protect
him at all cost.

00:00:45.918 --> 00:00:47.209
[Laughing]

00:00:49.834 --> 00:00:51.209
Ryan is an artist.

00:00:51.709 --> 00:00:54.083
He has the heart to listen to you.

00:00:54.834 --> 00:00:57.709
To look in your
eyes and go deep,

00:00:57.834 --> 00:01:00.542
not just in the story,
but in your soul.

00:01:01.375 --> 00:01:03.042
NATE MOORE
When you get down to what makes

00:01:03.167 --> 00:01:06.667
this movie human,
that is where Ryan really excels.

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:10.417
I think even in a world as fantastical

00:01:10.500 --> 00:01:14.626
and as magical and as exciting
as the Marvel Cinematic Universe...

00:01:16.042 --> 00:01:18.959
He just has an
understanding of people.

00:01:19.667 --> 00:01:22.292
RAMONDA
Now is our time.

00:01:26.584 --> 00:01:28.834
RIRI WILLIAMS
Let's go!

00:01:31.334 --> 00:01:33.834
There's an embracing of culture

00:01:34.417 --> 00:01:36.667
and Ryan is going
a step further.

00:01:37.083 --> 00:01:39.083
We're remembering,
we're restoring,

00:01:39.209 --> 00:01:40.292
we're celebrating.

00:01:42.751 --> 00:01:44.959
Above all, it is a relationship movie.

00:01:45.375 --> 00:01:47.417
We'll have some incredible set pieces...

00:01:49.792 --> 00:01:51.167
But at the end of the day,
I think what people are going to

00:01:51.417 --> 00:01:52.959
really remember
is the conversations.

00:01:54.417 --> 00:01:59.375
How do you move forward after
losing someone that meant so much to you?

00:02:01.709 --> 00:02:04.542
You have to continue their legacy.

